{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21007","main_id":21007,"main_title":"孤木孑立，无林可依","main_description":"在「明蕴镇」里，突然遇见了一位奇怪的老爷爷…","chapter_title":"孤木孑立，无林可依","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":2100706,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2100706,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":210070606,"next_line_ids":[210070607],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20069,"speaker_text_hash":1590479125,"speaker":"元鸿","speaker_raw":"元鸿","text_hash":4182155861,"text":"你们都觉得，我把宝贝藏在了矿洞里…","raw_text":"你们都觉得，我把宝贝藏在了矿洞里…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2100706.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21007","main_id":21007,"main_title":"孤木孑立，无林可依","main_description":"在「明蕴镇」里，突然遇见了一位奇怪的老爷爷…","chapter_title":"孤木孑立，无林可依","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":2100706,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2100706,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":210070607,"next_line_ids":[210070608],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20069,"speaker_text_hash":1590479125,"speaker":"元鸿","speaker_raw":"元鸿","text_hash":2360743693,"text":"但是，我哪里有什么宝贝…你们还记得这棵树吗，这是你们小时候，我们全家一起栽的…","raw_text":"但是，我哪里有什么宝贝…你们还记得这棵树吗，这是你们小时候，我们全家一起栽的…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2100706.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-21007","main_id":21007,"main_title":"孤木孑立，无林可依","main_description":"在「明蕴镇」里，突然遇见了一位奇怪的老爷爷…","chapter_title":"孤木孑立，无林可依","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":5,"subquest_id":2100706,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2100706,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":210070608,"next_line_ids":[210070609],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20069,"speaker_text_hash":1590479125,"speaker":"元鸿","speaker_raw":"元鸿","text_hash":2581773101,"text":"我每年都会过来，在这里面埋点东西，希望你们长大之后，我们全家再一起去挖出来。","raw_text":"我每年都会过来，在这里面埋点东西，希望你们长大之后，我们全家再一起去挖出来。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2100706.json"}
